{"diagnosis": "Fetch test shows TRAP no progress with max_addr=0x00000000 and FAIL 0xdead after 2009 cycles, so no instruction fetch ever completed. Excerpt state 0 asserts mem_valid on mem_do_prefetch/mem_do_rinst/mem_do_rdata but holds mem_state at 0 instead of advancing to wait for mem_ready. Stuck mem_state prevents the fetch handshake from completing so PC never advances.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -581,7 +581,7 @@
 			case (mem_state)
 				0: begin
 					if (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata) begin
 						mem_valid <= !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word;
 						mem_instr <= mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst;
 						mem_wstrb <= 0;
-						mem_state <= 0;
+						mem_state <= 1;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead) with max_addr advancing past 0x00000000 and no TRAP no progress"}

